    "Estate and factory visits are arranged directly with the estate. Confirm\n      access before travelling, since working factories admit visitors only at\n      certain times of the processing day.": "庄园和工厂参观需直接与庄园安排。出行前请确认访问许可,因为运营中的工厂仅在加工日的特定时段接待访客。",
    "Kenya's best-known tea region, about 260km northwest of Nairobi in the Rift\nValley highlands. Large estates, tea factories that receive visitors, and the\nlandscape most people picture when they think of Kenyan tea.": "肯尼亚最知名的茶叶产区,位于内罗毕西北约260公里的裂谷高地。这里有大型庄园、接待访客的茶叶工厂,以及人们想到肯尼亚茶叶时最常联想到的景观。",
    "The closest tea country to Nairobi, under an hour from the city. Estates\nhere run short factory tours and tastings, which suits a half-day visit.": "距离内罗毕最近的茶叶产区,距市区不到一小时车程。这里的庄园提供简短的工厂参观和品茶活动,适合半日游。",
    "High-altitude estates in western Kenya, producing tea with a distinct\nprofile from Kericho's. Fewer visitors and a longer drive.": "肯尼亚西部的高海拔庄园,出产的茶叶风味与凯里乔截然不同。访客较少,车程较长。",
